<p>A <strong>bold span</strong> that wraps onto the next line stays one span.</p><ul><li>item <strong>wrapping   its bold</strong> here</li><li>plain item that wraps   onto a second line</li><li>with a nested list<ul><li>sub <strong>wrapping     its bold</strong> too</li></ul></li><li>last</li></ul><ol><li>ordered <strong>wrapping    its bold</strong> here</li><li>second</li></ol><blockquote>quote <strong>wrapping its bold</strong> here</blockquote><p>after</p>
